        notes: 'Verified against TWOIAF, The Targaryen Kings section. Note: TWOIAF spells the name ''Aelyx'' but GEDCOM imported as ''Aelix''. Son of Aerys (early Targaryen), Lord of Dragonstone. Source text: After them the lordship passed to their son Maegon, his brother Aerys, and Aerys''s sons, Aelyx, Baelon, and Daemion.'
